  "summary_en": "UK statutory instrument made under the EU (Withdrawal) Act 2018. It amends the 2019 Brexit regulations for human medicines and medical devices: orphan and paediatric medicine procedures, pharmacovigilance definitions, designated standards for devices, and updates to manufacturer registration. It does not cover AI or robotics.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Adds procedures for representations to the appropriate committee on orphan criteria and paediatric investigation plan decisions",
   "Adds the Republic of Korea to the list of countries with equivalent manufacturing standards for active substances",
   "Counts European Pharmacopoeia monographs as designated standards for medical devices",
   "Requires device manufacturers to report changes to their registration information",
   "Defines 'signal evaluation' for periodic safety update reports"
  ],
